WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:02.790
Your team in 2 minutes

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:07.780
A new season is starting? Your team is ready in two minutes.

00:00:08.780 --> 00:00:11.990
Enter the team name, its category and your town.

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:17.920
Add your players: first name, last name, number. That’s it.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:22.370
Then your games: the opponent, the date, the time.

00:00:23.370 --> 00:00:28.400
For each player, note the positions they prefer, the ones to develop and the ones to avoid.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:33.180
And your season is ready: the next game is waiting on the home screen.

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:38.590
BaseballLineup. Less paperwork, more baseball.
